      <uighur>nebderelčekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>нэвтрэлцэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>NEBTERELCE-</transcript>
      <definition>[v. coop. of nebtere-] Tobe in connection, have connection.</definition>
      <page>568</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠢᠮᠡᠭᠡ ᠨᠠᠪᠲᠠᠷᠠᠯᠴᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>cimege --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To exchange news or letters, correspond.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠡᠯᠡ ᠨᠠᠪᠲᠠᠷᠠᠯᠴᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>kele --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To [be able to] communicate in a language.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠣᠩᠭᠤᠯ ᠺᠡᠯᠡ ᠪᠡᠷ ᠨᠠᠪᠲᠠᠷᠠᠯᠴᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>mongγul kele ber --ky</transcript>
          <definition> To communicate in Mongolian.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠷᠢᠯᠴᠠᠨ ᠨᠠᠪᠲᠠᠷᠠᠯᠴᠠᠺᠥ ᠶᠠᠪᠤᠳᠠᠯ</unicode>
